  "note": {
    "title": "Corbel call: SSO on day one is a contract condition",
    "content": "",
    "note_type": "meeting",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-1",
        "text": "Thanks for joining, Dana. Today is mostly SSO and SAML.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050403989,
        "startMs": 3989,
        "endMs": 8542,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-2",
        "text": "Right. SSO with SAML is the hard requirement for us.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050410215,
        "startMs": 10215,
        "endMs": 15384,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-3",
        "text": "Every login at Corbel goes through our identity provider, so SSO over SAML is the only way in.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050416340,
        "startMs": 16340,
        "endMs": 25836,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-4",
        "text": "SSO ships with the launch on the 3rd, with SAML login and an admin setup screen.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050426922,
        "startMs": 26922,
        "endMs": 34708,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-5",
        "text": "Can you do SSO with our identity provider on day one?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050435307,
        "startMs": 35307,
        "endMs": 41281,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-6",
        "text": "Yes, it's on the test plan.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050441793,
        "startMs": 41793,
        "endMs": 45081,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-7",
        "text": "Your identity provider has a known SAML clock issue, and the SSO fix is in progress.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050445799,
        "startMs": 45799,
        "endMs": 54162,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-8",
        "text": "How long does SSO setup take for an admin?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050455690,
        "startMs": 55690,
        "endMs": 60488,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-9",
        "text": "About ten minutes, with the SAML metadata.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050461287,
        "startMs": 61287,
        "endMs": 64938,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-10",
        "text": "Ten minutes is fine. Our admins hate long SSO setups, and they hate SAML errors more.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050465650,
        "startMs": 65650,
        "endMs": 73935,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-11",
        "text": "Good. SSO on day one is a contract condition for us, not a nice-to-have.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050474580,
        "startMs": 74580,
        "endMs": 81990,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-12",
        "text": "Understood. We'll write the SSO condition into the contract.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050482494,
        "startMs": 82494,
        "endMs": 86500,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-13",
        "text": "On pricing, the enterprise quote is forty-eight a seat, two hundred seats.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050487244,
        "startMs": 87244,
        "endMs": 92655,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-14",
        "text": "Forty-eight a seat is fine. The discount is the conversation.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050493691,
        "startMs": 93691,
        "endMs": 98888,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-15",
        "text": "Our finance team wants a thirty percent discount on the seat price, for two years.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050499659,
        "startMs": 99659,
        "endMs": 107252,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-16",
        "text": "Thirty percent with a two-year term works for us.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050507822,
        "startMs": 107822,
        "endMs": 111955,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-17",
        "text": "Two hundred seats on a two-year term also gets the onboarding package, at no discount cost to you.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050512717,
        "startMs": 112717,
        "endMs": 120527,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-18",
        "text": "The onboarding package matters more than the discount, honestly.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050521886,
        "startMs": 121886,
        "endMs": 126290,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-19",
        "text": "Our CFO signs anything over a hundred thousand a year, so the discount has to land under that.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050527063,
        "startMs": 127063,
        "endMs": 135957,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-20",
        "text": "Thirty percent is our discount floor for a two-year term, so that one's easy.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050537112,
        "startMs": 137112,
        "endMs": 144016,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-21",
        "text": "And the platform fee.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050545172,
        "startMs": 145172,
        "endMs": 147408,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-22",
        "text": "The platform fee has no discount. Eight thousand a year, at list.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050548299,
        "startMs": 148299,
        "endMs": 153791,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-23",
        "text": "Last item, the SOC 2 report. Security won't sign without the SOC 2 report.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050554747,
        "startMs": 154747,
        "endMs": 162208,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-24",
        "text": "The SOC 2 report lands in December, with a bridge letter until then.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050563023,
        "startMs": 163023,
        "endMs": 168937,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-25",
        "text": "Would a bridge letter work for your security team?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050569568,
        "startMs": 169568,
        "endMs": 173977,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-26",
        "text": "Our security team accepted one last year.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050574718,
        "startMs": 174718,
        "endMs": 178546,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-27",
        "text": "A bridge letter plus the SOC 2 audit dates should be enough for the security review.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050579235,
        "startMs": 179235,
        "endMs": 187338,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-28",
        "text": "Ruth will send you the SOC 2 audit dates once the auditors confirm.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050588281,
        "startMs": 188281,
        "endMs": 194717,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-29",
        "text": "Ruth can also walk your security team through the SOC 2 audit scope.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050595707,
        "startMs": 195707,
        "endMs": 201895,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-30",
        "text": "Then we're close. SSO on day one, thirty percent for two years, and the bridge letter.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050603092,
        "startMs": 203092,
        "endMs": 211220,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-31",
        "text": "One more. Is there a data residency option for Canada?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050612086,
        "startMs": 212086,
        "endMs": 217276,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Dana",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-32",
        "text": "Hmm.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050618506,
        "startMs": 218506,
        "endMs": 219169,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Marcus",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-musp3uhk-33",
        "text": "Let me check with engineering and come back to you this week.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1791050619772,
        "startMs": 219772,
        "endMs": 225959,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      }
    ],
    "enhanced_content": "Corbel's head of IT confirmed that SSO on day one is a contract condition. Pricing landed at 30% off for a two-year term, and a bridge letter should satisfy their security review.\n\n## Threads\n- **SSO.** Every Corbel login goes through their identity provider, so SSO with SAML on the 3rd is a hard requirement and goes into the contract. Their provider is the one with the known clock issue.\n- **Pricing.** $48 a seat for 200 seats. Corbel asked for 30% off on a two-year term, which is at Pellwood's floor; the platform fee stays at list.\n- **SOC 2.** The report lands in December. Corbel's security team accepted a bridge letter last year.\n\n## Action Items\n- [ ] Marcus: write the SSO condition into the contract.\n- [ ] Ruth: send Corbel the SOC 2 audit dates once the auditors confirm.\n- [ ] Maya: check data residency for Canada with engineering this week.\n\n## Follow-ups\n- Data residency for Canada: no answer yet.",
